    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22821" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γρᾰφίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραφεῖον</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.63
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Damoch.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				65
			</span></i> (Paul. Sil.), <i><span class="en">
				67
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>): esp. <i>stilus for writing</i> on waxen tablets, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				326d
			</span></i>; <i>paint-brush,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.178
			</span></i> (Antip.); <i>graving tool</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				32.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμβολα . . γραφίδεσσι κατέξυσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hymn.Is.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				4.3b
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				72
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <i>needle for embroidering,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				APl.
				4.324
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>embroidery,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.275
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>): but in pl., =
			<i>paintings</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				25.433
			</span></i>.</div>
